WEBVTT

00:08:59.201 --> 00:09:01.161
In fact, it was Maria Ramos.

00:09:01.829 --> 00:09:03.872
In 2019,

00:09:03.914 --> 00:09:07.876
Maria Ramos decides she's going to run
for Storm Lake City Council.

00:09:08.586 --> 00:09:10.087
And she wins.

00:09:10.129 --> 00:09:13.757
And she's supported by Mark Prosser
and so many others from Storm Lake

00:09:13.757 --> 00:09:16.176
who've been fighting
for immigrants and immigration

00:09:16.218 --> 00:09:17.386
over these decades.

00:09:17.428 --> 00:09:19.763
As Maria told the local paper,

00:09:19.805 --> 00:09:21.724
"We needed woman representation

00:09:21.724 --> 00:09:23.809
and what's better than a Latina woman?"

00:09:23.809 --> 00:09:25.019
(Laughter)

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.520
And as I was sitting with her,

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.646
she told me,

00:09:27.688 --> 00:09:30.899
"I would not be able to do what I do
if I had stayed in Mexico.